    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Water is important to us. However, around one in three people worldwide don’t have safe drinking water near their homes. Every day, 800 children under the age of five die as a result of water problems."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Deepika Kurup, now 23, had a happy childhood in the United States. But her Indian-born parents took her to visit their home country every year. It didn’t take long for the girl to realise how different it was from the United States. When she was 14 years old, she noticed one day that some children around her age there were collecting water that was "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "obviously",
            "ref": "v-obviously"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " dirty. “They really shocked me,” Kurup says. “That was the only water that they could get to drink and to cook their food with!”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Kurup’s father is an engineering professor. Unsurprisingly, the girl became interested in science at a young age. She even has a small lab in her father’s garage. After realising that millions of people around the world live without clean water, Kurup wanted to solve the problem."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Kurup ended up creating an affordable and effective water "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "purification",
            "ref": "v-purification"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " system. With the help of sunlight, the system can greatly reduce the number of bacteria present in water. The invention has won many awards."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "But over the years, Kurup gradually realised that her system alone wasn’t enough to solve the world’s water problems. These problems are just too complex. There should be many other solutions. Some might work better than hers in some situations. The girl expects others to come up with great ideas."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Meanwhile, Kurup has been improving her water purification system. Different communities have different needs, and she would like to see more people really benefit from her invention."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
